---
// Segment router: the three audiences this site serves arrive with different
// questions (briefings/impact-playbook/AUDIENCES.md in the clawd repo).
// Residents want help and their ward facts. Journalists want checkable figures
// fast. Data readers want the numbers. One card each, first screenful.
---

<section class="audience-paths" aria-label="Start here">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="paths-grid">
      <div class="path-card">
        <span class="path-num">01</span>
        <h2 class="path-title"><a href="/contact/">Live in Padiham or Burnley?</a></h2>
        <p class="path-desc">Raise a problem, get help with a council issue, or see what is being spent in your ward.</p>
        <span class="path-secondary">
          Get the <a href="/updates/">weekly update</a> on the area, or
          <a href="https://www.gov.uk/apply-postal-vote" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">set up a postal vote</a> in about five minutes.
        </span>
      </div>

      <div class="path-card">
        <span class="path-num">02</span>
        <h2 class="path-title"><a href="/news/">Read the investigations</a></h2>
        <p class="path-desc">Public spending, housing, health and policing in Burnley, Padiham and Lancashire, each piece with its sources.</p>
        <span class="path-secondary">Reporting on Lancashire? <a href="/press/">Method, data and contact routes for journalists</a>.</span>
      </div>

      <div class="path-card">
        <span class="path-num">03</span>
        <h2 class="path-title"><a href="/projects/">Want the numbers?</a></h2>
        <p class="path-desc">Council spending, population, elections and asylum data. Four open sites, every figure traced to its source.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .audience-paths {
    padding: 0 0 var(--space-xl);
  }

  .paths-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    /* The hero's figures strip above supplies the top rule. */
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .path-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-xs);
    padding: var(--space-lg) var(--space-lg) var(--space-lg) 0;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
  }

  .path-card + .path-card {
    border-left: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding-left: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .path-num {
    color: var(--gold);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }

  .path-title {
    font-size: 1.3125rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .path-title a {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: var(--touch);
    color: var(--ink);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .path-title a::after {
    content: '→';
    margin-left: 10px;
    color: var(--teal);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
  }

  .path-title a:hover { color: var(--teal); text-decoration: underline; }

  .path-desc {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin: 0;
    flex-grow: 1;
  }

  .path-secondary {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .paths-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .path-card,
    .path-card + .path-card {
      padding: var(--space-md) 0;
      border-left: 0;
    }

    .path-card + .path-card {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    }
  }
</style>
